@host = https://localhost:7056

### Staff session status (open to everyone)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Unlock staff access (password from Settings, or env var Auth__StaffPassword until one is set)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/unlock
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "{{$processEnv Auth__StaffPassword}}" }

### Change the staff password (staff only)
PUT {{host}}/api/auth/password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "{{$processEnv Auth__StaffPassword}}", "newPassword": "change-me-123" }

### Product lookup by barcode (open to everyone)
GET {{host}}/api/products/7020000000001

### Stock levels (staff only)
GET {{host}}/api/inventory

### Lock again
POST {{host}}/api/auth/lock
